    "description": "Stage 13 (2026-08-31): the reset-poisoned model pairing fixed (one giant-\u03be sample per episode regressing the pre-fall command against the post-rescue state, ~40/min \u2014 enough to sign-scramble A against the probed authority in every prior arm).  C-only prior.",
